<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Updated Items Needed for your Pre-Approval" recipientType="Lead">
<messaging:htmlEmailBody >
<html>
<head>
<style type="text/css">
.myButton {
    display: inline-block;
    vertical-align: middle;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #0082cb;
    font: normal normal bold 20px arial;
    color: #ffffff !important;
    text-decoration: none;
}
.myButton:hover,
.myButton:focus {
    background: #142850;
    cursor: pointer;
}
</style>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<span class="container"></span>
<p>Hi {{BORROWER_FIRST_NAME}},<br />
<br />
Good news first: you are already pre-approved, and nothing about that has changed. A few of the documents on file have simply aged out or need refreshing so your approval stays current and ready when you find the right home.</p>
<p>Here is what I need from you:</p>
{{REQUESTED_DOCUMENT_LIST}}
<br />
<p>You can upload everything in one place:</p>
<div><a class="myButton" href="{{LEAD_PORTAL_LINK}}">Upload Files</a></div>
<br />
<p>Once these are in, I will refresh your approval and send you an updated letter. If anything on the list no longer applies, or your situation has changed since we last spoke, just reply and let me know.</p>
<span class="end-container"></span>
<p>{{SENDER_SIGNATURE}}</p>
</body>
</html>
</messaging:htmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>
